WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.018 --> 00:00:19.561
Perda thought as she, Zann, and Zing landed from a zap and saw signs of civilization.

2
00:00:19.581 --> 00:00:23.584
"This must be the village Vilkor mentioned yesterday," Zann said.

3
00:00:24.264 --> 00:00:26.125
It was the day after they'd found Mellis.

4
00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:30.948
They'd spent the morning following Vilkor's group farther up into the mountains.

5
00:00:31.936 --> 00:00:36.578
The village consisted of about a dozen rough huts built on a steep, craggy ridge.

6
00:00:37.258 --> 00:00:41.980
The only flat area contained a rough but strong-looking curved stone wall.

7
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.983
"I bet that's where the villagers hide from rock trompers and other scary stuff," Perda said.

8
00:00:48.003 --> 00:00:51.224
"This whole place is kind of scary, isn't it?"

9
00:00:51.604 --> 00:00:52.165
Zann said.

10
00:00:52.765 --> 00:00:57.627
Tufts of weedy grass and slimy-looking moss grew here and there on the rocky ground.

11
00:00:58.167 --> 00:00:59.888
The forest was dark and thick.

12
00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:02.922
Vines seemed to choke the twisted trees.

13
00:01:02.942 --> 00:01:05.104
"Who would want to live here?"

14
00:01:05.504 --> 00:01:06.105
Zann asked.

15
00:01:06.125 --> 00:01:08.207
"Those people, I guess."

16
00:01:09.067 --> 00:01:13.771
Perda watched as a crowd of people emerged from their huts to face Vilkor and his group.

17
00:01:13.791 --> 00:01:15.933
"Who are you?"

18
00:01:16.414 --> 00:01:18.495
a man called, sounding suspicious.

19
00:01:18.515 --> 00:01:20.357
"What are you doing here?

20
00:01:20.937 --> 00:01:22.759
We don't like outsiders."

21
00:01:22.779 --> 00:01:26.662
"You'll like me, I promise."

22
00:01:27.203 --> 00:01:28.704
Vilkor sounded confident.

23
00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:36.945
"I am your supreme ruler, and I've come to bless you with the wonders of my magic powers."

24
00:01:37.965 --> 00:01:39.286
"Supreme ruler?"

25
00:01:39.306 --> 00:01:42.588
a woman said with a laugh.

26
00:01:42.608 --> 00:01:47.371
"Step back, or you'll meet the magic of our sharp spears!"

27
00:01:48.291 --> 00:01:52.314
Several other villagers murmured in agreement and lifted their crude weapons.

28
00:01:53.634 --> 00:01:54.535
Vilkor chuckled.

29
00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:59.242
"I was hoping we could do this the easy way.

30
00:01:59.902 --> 00:02:00.263
Oh well.

31
00:02:00.623 --> 00:02:02.664
Perhaps this will convince you."

32
00:02:03.405 --> 00:02:07.148
He rubbed his hands together and then waved them dramatically over his head.

33
00:02:07.708 --> 00:02:10.790
"Behold my awesome power!"

34
00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:14.913
Bursts of colorful light erupted all over the area.

35
00:02:15.614 --> 00:02:17.315
The villagers gasped in fear.

36
00:02:17.975 --> 00:02:20.377
Some ran behind the stone wall to hide.

37
00:02:21.418 --> 00:02:23.960
Perda noticed that Mellis was snapping her fingers.

38
00:02:24.648 --> 00:02:29.852
Each time she did, a weapon flew out of a villager's hands and landed behind Vilkor's group.

39
00:02:29.872 --> 00:02:35.357
"Mellis is doing more practical magic, as usual," she whispered to Zann.

40
00:02:35.377 --> 00:02:41.062
"Vilkor likes flashy spells, but he always makes Mellis do the harder work."

41
00:02:41.802 --> 00:02:47.307
She remembered with disgust how Vilkor had expected his niece to dig the well all by herself.

42
00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:49.789
The villagers shouted in alarm.

43
00:02:49.809 --> 00:02:52.391
"Who are you, and what do you want?"

44
00:02:52.851 --> 00:02:53.532
a man cried.

45
00:02:54.412 --> 00:02:55.173
"I told you.

46
00:02:55.453 --> 00:02:57.954
I am the ruler of all the land."

47
00:02:58.734 --> 00:03:00.455
Vilkor rubbed his hands together.

48
00:03:01.076 --> 00:03:03.997
He pointed at one of the huts, causing it to explode.

49
00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:06.699
"My house!"

50
00:03:07.159 --> 00:03:07.999
a villager cried.

51
00:03:08.019 --> 00:03:09.680
"What's he doing?"

52
00:03:10.081 --> 00:03:10.661
Perda cried.

53
00:03:10.681 --> 00:03:14.043
"He won't win them over by destroying their homes!"

54
00:03:14.803 --> 00:03:16.884
Mellis seemed to be thinking the same thing.

55
00:03:17.524 --> 00:03:19.926
She grabbed her uncle's arm and shook her head.

56
00:03:20.466 --> 00:03:23.908
Then she snapped her fingers and magically repaired the hut.

57
00:03:24.524 --> 00:03:26.726
The villagers gasped and then cheered.

58
00:03:27.767 --> 00:03:29.028
But Mellis wasn't finished.

59
00:03:29.489 --> 00:03:31.030
She pointed at the stone wall.

60
00:03:31.891 --> 00:03:37.996
Seconds later it was taller and stronger than before, with a sturdy roof and a solid wooden door.

61
00:03:38.757 --> 00:03:40.198
The villagers gasped again.

62
00:03:40.218 --> 00:03:42.861
"The rock trompers will never reach us now!"

63
00:03:43.241 --> 00:03:44.122
a woman exclaimed.

64
00:03:44.142 --> 00:03:45.863
"Thank you, strangers!"

65
00:03:45.883 --> 00:03:51.248
"You're welcome," Vilkor said, stepping in front of Mellis.

66
00:03:51.268 --> 00:03:55.390
"Now I'll tell you more about my amazing powers."

67
00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:59.672
He levitated onto the roof, to more gasps from the crowd.

68
00:04:00.413 --> 00:04:01.593
Then he looked around.

69
00:04:01.613 --> 00:04:05.835
"Hmm, nice view from up here," he said.

70
00:04:05.855 --> 00:04:09.817
"Very secure, too, with dense forest all around.

71
00:04:10.417 --> 00:04:13.819
This might be a good place to build a fortress for myself."

72
00:04:14.659 --> 00:04:16.640
He pointed to Mellis.

73
00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:23.124
"Join me, dear niece, while I tell these villagers how lucky they are that I've mastered the wonders

74
00:04:23.204 --> 00:04:23.805
of magic."

75
00:04:24.645 --> 00:04:27.227
Mellis floated up to stand beside her uncle.

76
00:04:27.247 --> 00:04:29.428
"Good," Zann whispered.

77
00:04:29.448 --> 00:04:33.130
"It will be easier for her to put our plan into action from up there.

78
00:04:33.791 --> 00:04:36.272
Especially since Vilkor thinks she's still muted."

79
00:04:37.073 --> 00:04:37.813
Perda nodded.

80
00:04:38.874 --> 00:04:43.674
She'd woken up that morning with an idea for a plan, and she and Zann had sneaked into

81
00:04:43.734 --> 00:04:46.837
camp to tell Mellis about it before everyone else woke up.

82
00:04:47.617 --> 00:04:53.083
Once the villagers were gathered, Mellis was supposed to speak up and tell them the truth about friction.

83
00:04:53.103 --> 00:04:54.724
"Do you think it will work?"

84
00:04:55.125 --> 00:04:59.949
Zann asked as Vilkor began to speak bombastically about his amazing powers.

85
00:04:59.969 --> 00:05:04.233
"Some Terricans seem to have trouble believing they can do magic themselves."

86
00:05:04.253 --> 00:05:07.036
"That's true," Perda said.

87
00:05:07.628 --> 00:05:12.869
"But hearing those servants talking in the woods last night makes me think people are starting to believe

88
00:05:12.929 --> 00:05:16.390
it. Let's disguise ourselves and hide in the crowd.

89
00:05:17.111 --> 00:05:22.272
That way we can start showing people what to do once they hear what Mellis has to say."

90
00:05:22.292 --> 00:05:23.832
"Good idea."

91
00:05:24.353 --> 00:05:29.554
Zann rubbed his hands together and used a Cloaking spell to make himself look more like the villagers.

92
00:05:30.154 --> 00:05:31.094
Perda did the same.

93
00:05:31.734 --> 00:05:35.536
They also used a Cloaking spell to make Zing resemble a large bird.

94
00:05:36.676 --> 00:05:38.961
Meanwhile Vilkor was still speaking.

95
00:05:38.981 --> 00:05:47.964
"And with the mighty powers I now possess, I shall turn Terrica into a peaceful and prosperous land.

96
00:05:48.665 --> 00:05:56.008
If you follow me, I'll shower you with magical wonders beyond your wildest dreams."

97
00:05:56.028 --> 00:05:59.970
"Are you the only one who can perform these magical wonders?"

98
00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:01.270
a man called out.

99
00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.691
"Yes!" Vilkor cried.

100
00:06:03.711 --> 00:06:11.828
"Er, that is, my niece also possesses some ability, along with a couple of other assistants back in

101
00:06:11.888 --> 00:06:12.568
the village."

102
00:06:12.588 --> 00:06:15.190
"Is he talking about Zira and Krub?"

103
00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:16.210
Zann whispered.

104
00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:19.172
"I wonder how they'd like being called his assistants!"

105
00:06:20.012 --> 00:06:21.073
"Shh," Perda said.

106
00:06:21.093 --> 00:06:23.314
"I think Mellis is about to speak."

107
00:06:24.055 --> 00:06:28.377
She held her breath, watching Mellis square her shoulders and step forward.

108
00:06:29.278 --> 00:06:30.338
Would their plan work?

109
00:06:31.179 --> 00:06:32.660
Vilkor was still talking.

110
00:06:33.184 --> 00:06:39.928
"However, I've decided that a land made fertile and affluent through magic needs a better name than Terrica,

111
00:06:40.328 --> 00:06:42.490
so I'm officially renaming it.

112
00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:49.414
From here on, you may refer to me as the supreme ruler of the great land now known

113
00:06:49.614 --> 00:06:54.077
as He waved his hands, sending up puffs of smoke and glitter.
